# Title bar version

Arrs Hub shows the app version in the OS/Electron window title bar, matching Market Advisor:

`Arrs Hub v{semver} — {tagline}`

- Source: `src/version.ts` (`APP_WINDOW_TITLE`), mirrored in `desktop/main.cjs` for BrowserWindow and set on `document.title` in the UI.
- Keep title-bar version in sync whenever `package.json` version changes.
